KEEFTALK DESKTOP OPEN SOURCE LICENSING FRAMEWORK
==============================================================================

Keeftalk is free to use, free to modify, free to fork, free to self-host,
and free from advertisements and behavioral tracking. Users never pay
subscriptions to unlock application functionality.

